  "integration_notes": [
    "research_store keeps PR12 position capture-slot columns and PR23 single-context pool-capture filtering",
    "calibration_queue keeps PR23 future-prestate classification and PR20 env-only RPC commands",
    "storage keeps PR12 position capture slots plus PR43 append-only observer attempt ledger and PR31 bounded-task attempt ledger",
    "quote and position observer failures are categorical and do not expose raw transport/RPC error text",
    "neutral position collection reserves revisit capacity when budget permits so fee/reward intervals can accumulate without starving exploration",
    "complete, non-truncated pool-position discovery is cached operationally for one hour by default; position inspection throughput is unchanged and the cache can be disabled with PIO_PHASE2_POSITION_DISCOVERY_CACHE_SECONDS=0",
    "confirmed Solana RPC rate-limit responses stop the current network stage and skip later Solana RPC stages in the same cycle while database-only reconciliation and calibration continue"
  ],
